1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
we surveyed developers a few months ago

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:07,900
asking which tasks they thought agents were best suited to perform today

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:10,820
the second most answered one

4
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:14,320
